    <http://def.isotc211.org/iso19108/2006/TemporalObjects#TM_Object>,
    <http://def.isotc211.org/iso19115/2006/DataQualityInformation#DQ_Element>,
    skos:Concept,
    prov:Location,
    <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/weg#Rijrichting>,
    <https://def.isotc211.org/iso19156/2011/Observation#OM_Observation.phenomenonTime>,
    <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/weg#rijrichting>,
